<title>USA: VSE Corp raises quarterly dividend.</title>
<headline>VSE Corp raises quarterly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ALEXANDRIA, Va. 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>VSE Corp increased its quarterly dividend to $0.045 U.S. cents from four U.S. cents on Friday.</p>
<p>The $0.045 dividend rate will be paid on November 22 1996 to stockholders of record November 1 1996.</p>
<p>VSE, established in 1959, is a professional services company which, along with its subsidiaries, provides engineering, information and technical services, products and commercial software to maintain equipment.</p>
